+# Starlight Founder Collective
+## Visible Proof - First 4 Quests (Tier 2)
+
+These quests are designed to be challenging and agentic. Do not settle for manual effort where AI can leverage your output.
+
+---
+
+### WEEK 1: Visible Proof: Mind Map Quest (Founder Collective Edition)
+**Theme**: Visible Proof
+**Difficulty**: advanced
+**Quest ID**: `week-1-visible-proof-mind_map`
+
+#### Challenge Prompt
+[Agentic Challenge] Create your model of human change and make the model visible. 
+Requirement: Your approach must be agentic. Delegate at least one major component of this quest to an AI agent, script, or automated workflow to multiply your leverage.
+
+#### Personal Prompt
+What pattern do you keep seeing that other people have not named clearly yet?
+
+#### Expected Artifact
+Model, diagram, essay, or tldraw board. (Must include proof of the agentic workflow used).
+*Proof type requirement: `map`*
+
+---
+
+### WEEK 2: Visible Proof: Freedom System Quest (Founder Collective Edition)
+**Theme**: Visible Proof
+**Difficulty**: advanced
+**Quest ID**: `week-2-visible-proof-freedom_system`
+
+#### Challenge Prompt
+[Agentic Challenge] Map one income, energy, time, or lifestyle lever that would increase practical freedom. 
+Requirement: Your approach must be agentic. Delegate at least one major component of this quest to an AI agent, script, or automated workflow to multiply your leverage.
+
+#### Personal Prompt
+What lever would make your life feel less rented and more authored?
+
+#### Expected Artifact
+Income or lifestyle lever map. (Must include proof of the agentic workflow used).
+*Proof type requirement: `doc`*
+
+---
+
+### WEEK 3: Visible Proof: Offer Seed Quest (Founder Collective Edition)
+**Theme**: Visible Proof
+**Difficulty**: advanced
+**Quest ID**: `week-3-visible-proof-offer_seed`
+
+#### Challenge Prompt
+[Agentic Challenge] Define one thing you can help people with and turn it into a tiny offer seed. 
+Requirement: Your approach must be agentic. Delegate at least one major component of this quest to an AI agent, script, or automated workflow to multiply your leverage.
+
+#### Personal Prompt
+What problem do people already bring you, even informally?
+
+#### Expected Artifact
+Offer sketch, landing copy, or short pitch. (Must include proof of the agentic workflow used).
+*Proof type requirement: `doc`*
+
+---
+
+### WEEK 4: Visible Proof: AI Companion Quest (Founder Collective Edition)
+**Theme**: Visible Proof
+**Difficulty**: advanced
+**Quest ID**: `week-4-visible-proof-ai_companion`
+
+#### Challenge Prompt
+[Agentic Challenge] Build one prompt, agent, or workflow that makes your week more intelligent. 
+Requirement: Your approach must be agentic. Delegate at least one major component of this quest to an AI agent, script, or automated workflow to multiply your leverage.
+
+#### Personal Prompt
+What recurring drag could an agent quietly remove this week?
+
+#### Expected Artifact
+Prompt, agent, workflow, script, or demo. (Must include proof of the agentic workflow used).
+*Proof type requirement: `prompt`*
+
+---
+
